whisper: Hop!'s records: the best time, and every point ever won, kept secret in a file, with a zipped copy.

use: encryption
use: hashing
use: json
use: big numbers
use: patterns
use: zip
use: time
use: folders

the world remembers:
  best time (a number)
  points ever (text)
  level print (text)
and the universe said i love you

to fingerprint the level, given level (text):
  set level print to the hash of with ("sha256", level)
and the universe said i love you

to load the record:
  set points ever to "0"
  if not file "hop.save" exists: cease
  try:
    set record to decrypted with (contents of file "hop.save", "hop hop hooray")
    if the json at with (record, "level") is not level print: raise a save problem with "was for a different level"
    set kept points to the json at with (record, "points")
    if not the pattern fits with ("^[0-9]+$", kept points): raise a save problem with "has broken points"
    set best time to the json number at with (record, "best")
    set points ever to kept points
  if that went wrong with a save problem:
    scrawl "Starting fresh: the record ", the wound
  if that went wrong:
    scrawl "Starting fresh: the record couldn't be read (", the wound, ")"
and the universe said i love you

to save the record, given seconds (a number) and points (a number):
  holding the lock "record":
    if best time is 0 or seconds falls below best time: set best time to seconds
    if points ever is "": set points ever to "0"
    set points ever to big plus with (points ever, "[points]")
    set record to the json changed at with ("{}", "best", "[best time]")
    set record to the json changed at with (record, "points", as json text points ever)
    set record to the json changed at with (record, "level", as json text level print)
    set record to the json changed at with (record, "day", as json text today)
    inscribe encrypted with (record, "hop hop hooray") into file "hop.save"
    pack the zip with (a list containing "hop.save", "hop backup.zip")
and the universe said i love you

to test the record:
  fingerprint the level with "a test level"
  save the record with (12.5, 900)
  set best time to 0
  load the record
  check best time is 12.5
  check points ever is "900"
  check the files in the zip "hop backup.zip" is a list containing "hop.save"
  erase the file "hop.save"
  erase the file "hop backup.zip"
and the universe said i love you

genesis:
  load the record
  scrawl "Best time: ", best time, " seconds. Points ever: ", points ever
and the universe said i love you
